                        <h2 class="section-title o_editable">The Art of<br/>Fine Perfumery</h2>
                        <p class="o_editable">Velora was born from a singular obsession: to bottle emotion. In our Grasse atelier, master perfumers blend the rarest absolutes and precious woods, aging every composition to perfection before it ever reaches you.</p>
                        <p class="o_editable">Every bottle is a promise — of craftsmanship, of heritage, and of a scent that becomes unmistakably yours.</p>

                        <div class="stats-grid">
                            <div class="stat">
                                <span class="stat-number" data-count="27">0</span>
                                <span class="stat-label">Years of Heritage</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat">
                                <span class="stat-number" data-count="150">0</span>
                                <span class="stat-label">Signature Scents</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat">
                                <span class="stat-number" data-count="2400">0</span>
                                <span class="stat-label">Happy Customers</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat">
                                <span class="stat-number" data-count="48">0</span>
                                <span class="stat-label">Countries Reached</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-6 col-12">
                        <div class="about-media reveal">
                            <img src="/theme_velora/static/src/img/img1.jpg"
                                 alt="Velora perfumer crafting fragrance in atelier" loading="lazy" class="o_we_custom_image"/>
